OL,3,GNEWSACity's revamp aims to create
OL,4,Ahundreds of jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of jobs are set to be created
OL,7,Fin Wolverhampton as part of
OL,8,Fredevelopment plans in the city, says
OL,9,Fthe council.
OL,11,FPlanning permission has been secured
OL,12,Ffor the four sites, known as Six Mile
OL,13,FGreen, near the University of
OL,14,FWolverhampton Science Park. The project
OL,15,Fis part of the city's Green Innovation
OL,16,FCorridor (GIC) programme.
OL,18,FOnce finished, it is expected to create
OL,19,Fup to 600 jobs and apprenticeships in
OL,20,Fsustainable construction, cyber
OL,21,Fsecurity, and engineering.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
