OL,3,GNEWSACity's revamp aims to create
OL,4,Ahundreds of jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The GIC will build upon
OL,7,FWolverhampton's sustainable
OL,8,Fconstruction, green credentials and
OL,9,Fcircular economy for transformation
OL,10,Fthat will create quality jobs and
OL,11,Ftraining opportunities for local
OL,12,Fpeople," council leader Stephen Simkins
OL,13,Fsaid.
